Value LOCAL_INTERFACE (\S+)
Value CHASSIS_ID (\S+)
Value PORT_ID (\S+)
Value PORT_DESCRIPTION (.*)
Value SYSTEM_NAME (\S+)

Start
  ^Local interface\s+:\s+${LOCAL_INTERFACE}
  ^Chassis ID\s+:\s+${CHASSIS_ID}
  ^Port ID\s+:\s+${PORT_ID}
  ^Port description\s+:\s+${PORT_DESCRIPTION}
  ^System name\s+:\s+${SYSTEM_NAME} -> Record
